  "about": "Public-records paper trail for SprayMap California. One row per request to a public agency: what we asked, when, what came back, and whether it is on the site yet. Agencies are named at office level; individual staff are not published. Dates are day-precise where confirmed from the spraymapca inbox, month-precise (YYYY-MM) where reconstructed. 'sent'/'acknowledged' rows with no reply after 30 days are shown as follow-up due. Maintained by the monthly data-asks task; humans commit.",
  "status_legend": {
    "drafted": "letter written, not yet sent",
    "sent": "request delivered to the agency, no substantive reply yet",
    "acknowledged": "agency confirmed receipt / assigned a reference",
    "awaiting_us": "the agency needs something from us (form, portal, clarification)",
    "delivered": "records received, not yet on the site",
    "ingested": "records received AND loaded into the site",
    "refused": "agency declined or produced nothing",
    "self_serve": "no request needed - agency publishes the data",
    "published": "state published the data; no request needed"
  },
